    // Schedule for the spatial stencil (per time-step) on a multicore CPU.
    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------
    //
    // We tile the 2D domain to improve cache locality, vectorize along x
    // (the innermost dimension, contiguous in memory), and parallelize
    // across tiles in y.
